abstract: "Strangecoin is a production-grade Layer-1 blockchain written from scratch in Rust for AI agents. It features PoW consensus, WASM smart contracts, Noise-encrypted P2P networking, Erlay reconciliation, and is MCP-native with ACP support for agent-to-agent communication."
